  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Exorcism"
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0131:00",
  "jp": "欲しいアイテムを依頼します。",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Request an item you want."
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0132:00",
  "jp": "特別な効果が得られる\n儀式を依頼します",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Request a ritual with a special effect."
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0133:00",
  "jp": "敵を倒してもらう依頼です\n次にダンジョンへ入る時、\nその敵が弱くなります",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "A request to defeat an enemy. It will be\nweaker next time you enter a dungeon."
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0134:00",
  "jp": "条件を変更する",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Change Terms"
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0135:00",
  "jp": "これで依頼する",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Send This Request"
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0136:00",
  "jp": "依頼先の選択",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Choose Recipient"
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0137:00",
  "jp": "依頼したい相手を選んでください。\nプロフィールが未登録、もしくはあなたへの通信を\n要請している人へは依頼できません",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Choose who to send a request to. You can't\nsend to anyone unregistered or asking to\nconnect to you."
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0138:00",
  "jp": "依頼を呼びかけています。\n相手が応じるまで\nそのままの状態でお待ち下さい",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Sending your request. Please wait without\nchanging anything until they respond."
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0139:00",
  "jp": "%sと\n接続しました。\nクエストを作成して下さい",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Connected with %s. Please create a quest."
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0140:00",
  "jp": "依頼を送信中です…",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Sending request..."
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0141:00",
  "jp": "%sへ\nクエストを依頼しました",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Sent a quest request to %s."
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0142:00",
  "jp": "相手との通信が切断されたか\nキャンセルされました\n依頼の送信処理を終了しています\nそのままの状態でお待ち下さい",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "The connection was lost or canceled. Ending\nthe sending process. Please wait without\nchanging anything."
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0143:00",
  "jp": "クエスト作成",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Create Quest"
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0144:00",
  "jp": "アイテム選択",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Choose Item"
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0145:00",
  "jp": "退魔選択",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Choose Foe"
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0146:00",
  "jp": "儀式選択",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Choose Ritual"
 },
 {
  "id": "questshoptext:0147:00",
  "jp": "依頼の送信を中断しています\nそのままの状態でお待ち下さい",
  "refs": 1,
  "en": "Canceling the request. Please wait without\nchanging anything."
 },
 {
